"id": "fastspeech-0001-001"
},
{
"en": "I'm gonna send it tomorrow.",
"jp": "明日送るつもり。",
"say": [],
"note": "gonna = going to。",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-002"
},
{
"en": "I gotta go. I've got a meeting.",
"jp": "行かなきゃ。会議があるんだ。",
"say": [],
"note": "gotta = have got to。",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-003"
},
{
"en": "Did you eat yet?",
"jp": "もう食べた？",
"say": [],
"note": "didja / jeet などと聞こえる。",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-004"
},
{
"en": "Whaddya think?",
"jp": "どう思う？",
"say": [],
"note": "What do you think? の縮約。",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-005"
},
{
"en": "I dunno. Maybe.",
"jp": "知らない。たぶんね。",
"say": [],
"note": "dunno = I don't know。",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-006"
},
{
"en": "Lemme check.",
"jp": "確認させて。",
"say": [],
"note": "lemme = let me。",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-007"
},
{
"en": "Gimme a second.",
"jp": "ちょっと待って。",
"say": [],
"note": "gimme = give me。",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-008"
},
{
"en": "Kinda tired, but I'm okay.",
"jp": "ちょっと疲れてるけど大丈夫。",
"say": [],
"note": "kinda = kind of。",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-009"
},
{
"en": "I coulda done it earlier.",
"jp": "もっと早くできたのに。",
"say": [],
"note": "coulda = could have。",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-010"
},
{
"en": "You shoulda told me.",
"jp": "言ってくれればよかったのに。",
"say": [],
"note": "",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-011"
},
{
"en": "I wouldn't've known.",
"jp": "知らなかったと思う。",
"say": [],
"note": "",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-012"
},
{
"en": "D'you have a pen?",
"jp": "ペン持ってる？",
"say": [],
"note": "D'you = Do you。",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-013"
},
{
"en": "Howdja get here?",
"jp": "どうやって来たの？",
"say": [],
"note": "How did you の縮約。",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-014"
},
{
"en": "Whaddaya want for lunch?",
"jp": "昼は何がいい？",
"say": [],
"note": "",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-015"
},
{
"en": "I'll call ya later.",
"jp": "あとで電話するね。",
"say": [],
"note": "ya = you。",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-016"
},
{
"en": "Got a minute?",
"jp": "ちょっといい？",
"say": [],
"note": "Do you have が省略される。",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-017"
},
{
"en": "Wanna grab a coffee?",
"jp": "コーヒーでもどう？",
"say": [],
"note": "",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-018"
},
{
"en": "Where're you from?",
"jp": "どこの出身？",
"say": [],
"note": "Where're = Where are。",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-019"
},
{
"en": "What's he doin'?",
"jp": "彼は何してるの？",
"say": [],
"note": "-ing の g が消える。",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-020"
},
{
"en": "It's a lot of work, innit?",
"jp": "大変な仕事だよね？",
"say": [],
"note": "innit = isn't it（英国の口語）。",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-021"
},
{
"en": "I'm tryna finish this by five.",
"jp": "5時までに終わらせようとしてるんだ。",
"say": [],
"note": "tryna = trying to。",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-022"
},
{
"en": "Y'all are welcome to join.",
"jp": "皆さん、ぜひ参加してください。",
"say": [],
"note": "y'all = you all（南部）。",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-023"
},
{
"en": "That's a good one, eh?",
"jp": "いいね、でしょ？",
"say": [],
"note": "eh? はカナダで多い。",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-024"
},
{
"en": "I can't make it. I've got a thing.",
"jp": "行けない。用事があって。",
"say": [],
"note": "",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-025"
},
{
"en": "I can't hear you. It's a bad line.",
"jp": "聞こえません。電波が悪いです。",
"say": [],
"note": "",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-026"
},
{
"en": "Okay, I'll text ya the address.",
"jp": "了解、住所を送るね。",
"say": [],
"note": "",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-027"
},
{
"en": "What'd he say?",
"jp": "彼は何て言った？",
"say": [],
"note": "What'd = What did。",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-028"
},
{
"en": "Where'd you put it?",
"jp": "どこに置いた？",
"say": [],
"note": "",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-029"
},
{
"en": "Why'd you do that?",
"jp": "なぜそうしたの？",
"say": [],
"note": "",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-030"
},
{
"en": "Could you've told me?",
"jp": "言えたんじゃない？",
"say": [],
"note": "",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-031"
},
{
"en": "Right, so basically, what happened was, the guy didn't show up.",
"jp": "つまり、要するに、その人が来なかったんだ。",
"say": [],
"note": "",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-032"
},
{
"en": "Yeah, no, I totally get it.",
"jp": "うん、いや、本当に分かるよ。",
"say": [],
"note": "Yeah, no は「いや大丈夫」の意味にもなる。",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-033"
},
{
"en": "I mean, like, it's not that bad, you know?",
"jp": "いや、つまり、そこまで悪くないよ、ね？",
"say": [],
"note": "like / you know は間をつなぐ言葉。",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-034"
},
{
"en": "Um, so, I was thinking maybe we could, like, move it to Friday?",
"jp": "えっと、金曜に動かせないかなって。",
"say": [],
"note": "",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-035"
},
{
"en": "Honestly, I kinda wanna skip it.",
"jp": "正直、ちょっと行くのをやめたい。",
"say": [],
"note": "",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-036"
},
{
"en": "It's not like I don't want to, it's just that I'm busy.",
"jp": "したくないわけじゃなく、忙しいだけ。",
"say": [],
"note": "",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-037"
},
{
"en": "Anyway, long story short, we're not going.",
"jp": "とにかく、要するに行かないことにした。",
"say": [],
"note": "",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-038"
},
{
"en": "Fair enough.",
"jp": "なるほど、それはもっともだ。",
"say": [],
"note": "",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-039"
},
{
"en": "Sounds good. Talk soon.",
"jp": "いいね。またすぐ話そう。",
"say": [],
"note": "",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-040"
},
{
"en": "Cool, cool. Appreciate it.",
"jp": "オーケー。ありがとう。",
"say": [],
"note": "",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-041"
},
{
"en": "Totally. No worries.",
"jp": "もちろん。気にしないで。",
"say": [],
"note": "",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-042"
},
{
"en": "Oh, for sure.",
"jp": "ああ、もちろん。",
"say": [],
"note": "",
"id": "fastspeech-0001-043"
},
{
